Act as a world-class product designer, UI/UX architect, senior full-stack engineer, AI/ML engineer, database architect and cybersecurity specialist.

Your task is to design and build **APPRENTICE IQ**, a premium, fully functional, AI-powered vocational learning, practical skill assessment and digital skill verification platform.

Do not build a generic LMS. Build an exceptional, industry-ready product that makes users and hackathon judges immediately understand its value.

